OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a chilly start it will be
OL,6,Fa mainly dry and bright day with best
OL,7,Fof the sunny spells over Lanarkshire
OL,8,Fand Ayrshire. Just the odd light
OL,9,Fshower will develop during the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mainly dry and bright
OL,13,Fevening but a few showers continuing
OL,14,Fover Argyll. A largely dry night with
OL,15,Fclear spells but the odd shower will
OL,16,Ffeed in from the west.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FA lot of dry and bright
OL,19,Fweather and feeling quite warm. The
OL,20,Fodd light shower is possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
