OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith long sunny spells on Monday and
OL,7,Fbecoming a little warmer. Outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain spread north on Tuesday and
OL,9,FWednesday.
